# The AI knowledge base is read byte-for-byte into the assistant prompt and
# bundled into lib/ai/kb.bundle.json for the Workers runtime (no filesystem).
# Pin these to LF so a contributor on Windows (core.autocrlf) cannot commit a
# CRLF bundle that diffs against the same content bundled on macOS/Linux.
knowledge/**/*.md text eol=lf
lib/ai/kb.bundle.json text eol=lf
